summary.label:
Comic Chat is a chat app where comic book, manga and webtoon fans meet new friends.

With Comic Chat, you can:
• impersonate your favourite manga, webtoon, bédé and comic book heroes;
• meet new friends, who are also manga and webtoon fans;
• type your text direct in the bubbles of comic book heroes;
• send funny, scary, angry, crying, laughing, etc. chat messages in comic book panels; 
• chat as your comic book heroes, chat for them and chat with them;
• recreate and parody well-known comic book scenes.
For each series, choose among up to twelve different packages.  Each package includes panels and heroes from a specific scene of the series.  Select the package according to the scene and heroes you want to use.  Select the package according to the mood of the conversation you want to start: flirting, action, fighting, etc.

Each package contains from 20 to 30 panels (or frames) from one scene.  In each package, exactly two heroes dialogue: choose one of both heroes as your avatar and type your own text direct in his or her bubble.  Swipe left and right to find the facial expression that best matches your message: surprise, anger, laughter, etc.

At least one package per series is for free.  Buy additional packages and invite your friends or new friends: they won't have to pay to chat with you.  Keep packages almost forever.  Chat with as many friends and contact as many new friends as you like.

Express yourself with complex and multi-layered comic book characters, not with simple and shallow emojis or stickers.  Chat fast, parody your heroes, use their expressions and slang, role-play and dialogue one-on-one, recreate a scene from memory, create messages that jar with the panels and heroes.  Show your wit and boast your geek culture!

You'll soon be able to choose among many different comic book series from the US, France, Japan, Korea and many more countries.  The offer is still small, but we will be adding new series regularly.  You can suggest series you want us to add to Comic Chat and we'll do our best to license them.

The following comic books are already included in Comic Chat:
• Lastman by Bastien Vivès, Balak, Michaël Sanlaville (Casterman)
• La Petite Mort by Davy Mourier (Delcourt)

The following webtoons are already included in Comic Chat:
• Imitation by Kyung-ran Park (C&C Revolution) 
• Honey Blood by Na-rae Lee (C&C Revolution) 
• He, Him & Us by Scarf (C&C Revolution)
• Que Sera Sera by Gonarija and Soojung (Jaedam)
• The Prince's Lollipop by Jong-min Nah and Hana Kwon (Jaedam)

Comic Chat includes the following, standard chat app features:
• simple registration with mobile phone number;
• one-tap importing of contacts into app;
• blocking of messages by annoying contacts;
• UI in English, French, Korean and Japanese;
• always logged in; and
• message notifications preferences.

Comic Chat is free but some packages must be paid for.  The app requires an active online connection.  The titles, names, panels and characters included in the app are protected under copyright laws and belong to their respective rights holders.
